            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi na ine epakulipila indalama amashekeli ya silifa ikumi limo na shisano (15) pakumushita, nalundapo na matepe amakumi yane (40) aya bale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No kumweba namweba nati, “Iwe nomba wakulaikala na ine inshiku ishingi, kabili tecakwesha ukulacita ubupulumushi, nangu ukukwata umwaume wa pambali, na ine efyo nkaba kuli iwe” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pantu abena Israeli bali nokwikala inshiku ishingi ukwabula imfumu nangu kateeka, ukwabula ukutuulapo amalambo nangu ukukuula inceshi shakupepelapo, nangu icakufwala ca bashimapepo ica efodi nangufye ukukwata utulubi utwakupendwilako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo kwena panuma, elyo abana bakwa Israeli bakabwela kuli Yawe Lesa wabo, na kuli Davidi imfumu yabo. Lyena bakalakwatila Yawe akatiina, no kulashukila ifyabupe fyakwe ifisuma mu nshiku shakupelekesha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
